@startuml
title SaveEye telemetry: WIT component composition
top to bottom direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 250

package "Authoritative reusable component\ncomponents/saveeye-telemetry" {
  artifact "wit/world.wit\npwrusage:saveeye@0.1.0" as Wit
  component "Telemetry processor\nsrc/lib.rs" as Processor
  artifact "saveeye_telemetry.wasm\nWASIp2 production build" as TelemetryWasm
  Wit ..> Processor : generated export bindings
  Processor ..> TelemetryWasm : build
}

package "Pi edge app\niotdevices/SaveEyeEdgeListenerApp" {
  component "MQTT handler\nsrc/lib.rs" as EdgeHandler
  component "MQTT publisher\nsrc/forwarding.rs" as Forwarder
  artifact "save_eye_edge_listener_app.wasm\nadapter with telemetry import" as EdgeWasm
  artifact "composed.wasm\nloaded by spin.toml / ARM64 image" as EdgeComposed
  EdgeHandler --> Forwarder : prepared envelope + edge ID
  EdgeHandler ..> EdgeWasm : build
  Forwarder ..> EdgeWasm : build
  EdgeWasm ..> EdgeComposed : build.sh / wac plug
}

package "Native server app\npwerusage/pwrusagesensorbackend" {
  component "MQTT handler\nsrc/lib.rs" as BackendHandler
  component "PostgreSQL adapter\nsrc/storage.rs + sql/upsert_latest.sql" as Storage
  artifact "pwrusagesensorbackend.wasm\nadapter with telemetry import" as BackendWasm
  artifact "composed.wasm\nloaded by spin.toml / systemd service" as BackendComposed
  BackendHandler --> Storage : validated device serial, edge timestamp/ID,\nreading JSON and summary
  BackendHandler ..> BackendWasm : build
  Storage ..> BackendWasm : build
  BackendWasm ..> BackendComposed : build.sh / wac plug
}

Wit ..> EdgeHandler : generated import bindings\nworld: telemetry-client
Wit ..> BackendHandler : generated import bindings\nworld: telemetry-client
EdgeHandler --> Processor : processor.prepare(raw bytes,\nreceipt time, edge ID, serial filter)
BackendHandler --> Processor : processor.validate(envelope bytes)
TelemetryWasm ..> EdgeComposed : plug same processor export
TelemetryWasm ..> BackendComposed : plug same processor export

note right of Processor
Exports pwrusage:saveeye/processor@0.1.0.
prepare: envelope + summary, or filtered reason.
validate: validated fields for persistence.
Owns parsing, normalization, filtering,
envelope validation and summary formatting.
No Spin SDK, network or database credentials.
end note

legend bottom
  Solid arrows: logical calls; the processor runs inside each composed app.
  Dotted arrows: build-time binding generation, compilation and composition.
  Both final artifacts resolve the telemetry import and retain the MQTT handler export.
  No shared Rust path dependency and no separate telemetry network service.
  Production compositions use WASIp2 for Spin 4.2.6 / MQTT trigger 0.9.6.
  The reusable component is also validated with the WASIp3-first build script.
  Python credential generation and Mosquitto startup remain host-side deployment helpers.
endlegend
@enduml
